<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
    <title>Connect Strava</title>
    <style>
      body { margin: 0; padding: 24px 16px; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
             color: #1a1a1a; background: #ffffff; line-height: 1.5; }
      main { max-width: 28rem; margin: 0 auto; }
      .warning { font-weight: 600; }
      /* The name is the account owner's free choice: its own block, clipped,
         so stacked combining marks cannot spill over the warning above. */
      .name { display: block; overflow: hidden; line-height: 1.5; max-height: 4.5em;
              font-weight: 600; overflow-wrap: anywhere; margin: 0 0 24px; }
      .actions { display: flex; gap: 12px; }
      .actions a { flex: 1; display: block; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 6px;
                   text-align: center; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
      .continue { background: #1d4ed8; color: #ffffff; }
      .cancel { border: 1px solid #9ca3af; color: #1a1a1a; }
      .cancelled { display: none; }
      #cancelled:target { display: block; }
      #cancelled:target ~ .prompt { display: none; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <section id="cancelled" class="cancelled">
        <p>If you didn't press Continue, nothing was connected. If you did and didn't expect to,
          remove the app you just authorised, under My Apps in your Strava settings.</p>
        <p>You can close this page.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="prompt">
        <p class="warning">Only continue if you just pressed Connect Strava in the {{ app_name }}
          app on this phone. If someone sent you this link, cancel.</p>
        {% if name is not none %}
        <p>Your Strava account will be linked to the {{ app_name }} account named:</p>
        <div class="name"><bdi>{{ name }}</bdi></div>
        {% else %}
        <p>Your Strava account will be linked to a {{ app_name }} account.</p>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="cancel" href="{{ cancel_url }}">Cancel</a>
          <a class="continue" href="{{ continue_url }}">Continue</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
